File Index

/index.ts
Purpose: Barrel re-exporting the seeded RNG (ISeededRng/Mulberry32/createRng) and the salted combat RNG (combatSeed/createCombatRng/deriveCombatSalt).

/seeded-rng.ts
Purpose: Deterministic Mulberry32 seeded RNG behind ISeededRng — the engine's sole randomness source; state() is the seed so streams restore/replay.

/seeded-rng.test.ts
Purpose: Tests same-seed reproducibility and different-seed divergence.

/combat-rng.ts
Purpose: Salted combat RNG — mixes a per-match salt + a step counter into a replayable stream (createCombatRng) so defense rolls are deterministic yet unguessable across the network (online: crypto-random secret salt); deriveCombatSalt(seed) gives local/offline play a seed-reproducible salt.

/combat-rng.test.ts
Purpose: Tests that createCombatRng is reproducible per (salt, step) and diverges on a different salt or step.
